# Build artifacts - rebuilt inside the container
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
**/*.user

# Secrets - must never enter an image layer
**/local.settings.json

# Azurite emulator data
**/__azurite_db*.json
**/__blobstorage__/
**/__queuestorage__/
**/__tablestorage__/

# Version control and docs - not needed at runtime
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
docs/
README.md
*.md

# Docker files themselves
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
